  "review": [
    "All 14 generated atlases visually inspected via imagegen return (12 single-person sheets, family supplement, guard supplement).",
    "Main four emotion bodies are authored separately; no activity pose is a neutral alias.",
    "Daram floor investigation and panic use named semantic poses, standing thoughtful and quiet guilt are general dialogue defaults.",
    "Dad collapse/protect are special poses; quiet exhaustion is general distressed.",
    "Guard crouched register read is named check_records_low; three supplementary standing poses are general neutral/thinking/distressed.",
    "New face crops supplied for every pose including life actions and named emotional extras.",
    "Crop coordinates derived from alpha>128 connected components; no PNG resampling/painting/cleanup performed.",
    "Portable stool/crate/bucket and tools are integral sprites; runtime must stage them in clear floor/surface locations.",
    "No independent tail-layer animation newly authored for redesigned gray family in this acting batch. Existing orange-family layers must not be mixed."
  ],
